{"id":"1dace3e025338fca","group":"93","path":"93/93-thm-quasivariety-theorem.md","title":"thm-quasivariety-theorem","display":"thm-quasivariety-theorem","type":"theorem","metadata":{"book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","depends_on":["[[93-df-quasi-equational-class]]","[[93-df-algebra]]","[[93-df-similarity-type]]","[[93-df-quasivariety]]"],"display":"thm-quasivariety-theorem","label":"93-thm-quasivariety-theorem","aliases":["93-thm-quasivariety-theorem"],"type":"theorem"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"9a11ac7fb28e6200\" href=\"?note=9a11ac7fb28e6200\" title=\"93-df-quasi-equational-class\">93-df-quasi-equational-class</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"6730349967b8ffce\" href=\"?note=6730349967b8ffce\" title=\"93-df-algebra\">93-df-algebra</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ee84ed8b0fae5bc3\" href=\"?note=ee84ed8b0fae5bc3\" title=\"93-df-similarity-type\">93-df-similarity-type</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"14fa67446efa83b1\" href=\"?note=14fa67446efa83b1\" title=\"93-df-quasivariety\">93-df-quasivariety</a></span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-quasivariety-theorem"},{"key":"label","html":"93-thm-quasivariety-theorem"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-thm-quasivariety-theorem</span></div>"},{"key":"type","html":"theorem"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"thm-quasivariety-theorem-thm-quasivariety-theorem\">thm-quasivariety-theorem <code>thm-quasivariety-theorem</code></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau=\\langle S,\\alpha\\rangle\">\\(\\tau=\\langle S,\\alpha\\rangle\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X=\\mathrm{Var}_{93}\">\\(X=\\mathrm{Var}_{93}\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal K\">\\(\\mathcal K\\)</span> is a class candidate.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{QVar}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{QVar}_{93}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{QEqTh}_{93,\\tau}\">\\(\\operatorname{QEqTh}_{93,\\tau}\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Mod}^{\\mathrm q}_{\\tau}\">\\(\\operatorname{Mod}^{\\mathrm q}_{\\tau}\\)</span> have the exact signatures fixed in <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"14fa67446efa83b1\" href=\"?note=14fa67446efa83b1\" title=\"93-df-quasivariety\">93-df-quasivariety</a> and <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"9a11ac7fb28e6200\" href=\"?note=9a11ac7fb28e6200\" title=\"93-df-quasi-equational-class\">93-df-quasi-equational-class</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SimilarityType}(S,\\alpha)\">\\(\\mathrm{SimilarityType}(S,\\alpha)\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall\\mathbf A\\in\\mathcal K\\;\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)\">\\(\\forall\\mathbf A\\in\\mathcal K\\;\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{QEqTh}_{93,\\tau}(\\mathcal K)\">\\(\\operatorname{QEqTh}_{93,\\tau}(\\mathcal K)\\)</span> 只在此定义域上使用。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}quasivariety\\text{-}theorem}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{SimilarityType}(S,\\alpha)\\land\\tau=\\langle S,\\alpha\\rangle\\land(\\forall\\mathbf A\\in\\mathcal K\\;\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A))\\to\\Bigl[\\mathrm{QVar}_{93}(\\mathcal K,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathcal K=\\operatorname{Mod}^{\\mathrm q}_{\\tau}\n\\bigl(\\operatorname{QEqTh}_{93,\\tau}(\\mathcal K)\\bigr)\\Bigr]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}quasivariety\\text{-}theorem}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{SimilarityType}(S,\\alpha)\\land\\tau=\\langle S,\\alpha\\rangle\\land(\\forall\\mathbf A\\in\\mathcal K\\;\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A))\\to\\Bigl[\\mathrm{QVar}_{93}(\\mathcal K,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathcal K=\\operatorname{Mod}^{\\mathrm q}_{\\tau}\n\\bigl(\\operatorname{QEqTh}_{93,\\tau}(\\mathcal K)\\bigr)\\Bigr]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本断言只对固定有效相似型的代数类使用准等式理论算子，不给未定义输入赋值。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"thm-quasivariety-theorem-thm-quasivariety-theorem","text":"thm-quasivariety-theorem `thm-quasivariety-theorem`","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-quasi-equational-class","status":"resolved","id":"9a11ac7fb28e6200","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-quasi-equational-class]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-algebra","status":"resolved","id":"6730349967b8ffce","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-algebra]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-similarity-type","status":"resolved","id":"ee84ed8b0fae5bc3","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-similarity-type]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-quasivariety","status":"resolved","id":"14fa67446efa83b1","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-quasivariety]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-quasivariety","status":"resolved","id":"14fa67446efa83b1","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{QVar}_{93}$, $\\operatorname{QEqTh}_{93,\\tau}$, and $\\operatorname{Mod}^{\\mathrm q}_{\\tau}$ have the exact signatures fixed in [[93-df-quasivariety]] and [[93-df-quasi-equational-clas